  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCA - Salvador Capital Afro</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">SCA - Salvador Capital Afro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es ampliar la competitividad turstica de Salvador, potenciando los beneficios econmicos y sociales de la actividad, especialmente a travs de su principal ventaja comparativa: el turismo cultural vinculado a la cultura afrobrasilea. Los objetivos especficos: (i) fortalecer la oferta de turismo cultural afrocentrado en Salvador; (ii) revitalizar el Barrio del Comercio para consolidar su vocacin turstica; y (iii) mejorar el monitoreo y la promocin del turismo en Salvador, con nfasis en la oferta cultural afrocentrada.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to enhance the tourism competitiveness of Salvador, maximizing the economic and social benefits of the activity, especially through its main comparative advantage: cultural tourism linked to Afro-Brazilian culture. The specific objectives are: (i) to strengthen the offer of Afro-centered cultural tourism in Salvador; (ii) to revitalize the Commerce District to consolidate its tourism vocation; and (iii) to improve the monitoring and promotion of tourism in Salvador, with an emphasis on the Afro-centered cultural offer.</narrative>
  </description>
